    "sizes": [
      11.520000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      330.15,
      561.94,
      384.09
    ],
    "text": "Under its influence, a low-pressure area is likely to develop over the South Andaman Sea, adjoining Andaman and Nicobar Islands, and the Southeast Bay of Bengal around 30 November. Further, there is a low probability of this system intensifying into a depression over the Southeast Bay of Bengal around 02 December.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
